\itemize{
\item \code{record}: one row per keyed primitive, in paint order. \code{kind} (0 point,
1 rect, 2 path), \code{paint} (0-based row of \code{paints}), \code{key} (0-based index
into \code{keys}), \code{flags} (bitfield, see below), \code{clip} (1-based row of
\code{clips}, 0 = unclipped) and \code{panel} (1-based into \code{panels}: the innermost
named panel the mark is drawn in, as in \code{scene_model()$elements$panel};
0 = none). The \emph{i}-th record of a kind is the \emph{i}-th row of
that kind's table.
\item \code{point}: \code{cx}, \code{cy}, \code{r} (device px) and \code{shape} (0 circle, else the
