5 cross, 6 triangle down, 7 star).
\item \code{rect}: axis-aligned rectangles, top-left \code{x}, \code{y} and size \code{w}, \code{h}.
\item \code{path}: polygons and polylines. \code{xy} holds interleaved vertices,
\code{run_offset} the start of each run in vertices (one more entry than runs),
\code{path_offset} the start of each path in runs (one more than paths),
\code{closed} (1 = closed rings, 0 = open polylines) and \code{evenodd} (fill rule).
Curves are flattened.
\item \code{paints}: a data-frame-like list with \code{fill} and \code{stroke} (\code{"#rrggbbaa"}
or \code{NA} for none), \code{stroke_width} (device px), \code{dash} (comma-separated
device px, or \code{NA} for solid), \code{linecap} and \code{linejoin}.
\item \code{clips}: rectangles \code{x0}, \code{y0}, \code{x1}, \code{y1} (device px).
\item \code{keys}: the distinct keys in first-use order, as a character vector, or as
